- how to update progress tracking
- how to preserve architectural integrity

## Forbidden Patterns

Explicitly list:
- anti-patterns
- overengineering traps
- architectural drift examples
- code smells this project should avoid

--- PRD START ---
{prd}
--- PRD END ---
