"""

SESSION_TEMPLATE = """You are helping continue an AI-assisted coding session.

Use the project context below as the source of truth.

Your job:
1. Summarise the current state.
2. Identify the current goal.
3. Identify the next safest implementation step.
4. Call out any open questions or risks.
5. Provide a focused instruction block that can be used to start a coding agent.

Do not invent scope.

--- PROJECT CONTEXT START ---
{compiled_context}
--- PROJECT CONTEXT END ---
